    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Bibelot: Tiret sur Will</strong>\u00a0is a precision platformer for all and for speedrunners as well.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 players Local Co-op, other players can join at any moment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty modes</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy: All checkpoints are available, fewer spikes in levels, some platforms are added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal: Some checkpoints are available, all spikes, no platforms added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard: No checkpoint available, all spikes, no platforms added</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun Timer: ON by default, will only trigger when you start from Level 1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Timer: If Speedrun Timer is off, it will show a per level timer instead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun Training Mode: By toggling this, you can train on a level, it will show you your best time of the level, and finishing it will make you restart it instead of going to the next one</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Bibelot: Tiret sur Will</strong>\u00a0is a precision platformer for all and for speedrunners as well.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 players Local Co-op, other players can join at any moment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty modes</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy: All checkpoints are available, fewer spikes in levels, some platforms are added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal: Some checkpoints are available, all spikes, no platforms added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard: No checkpoint available, all spikes, no platforms added</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun Timer: ON by default, will only trigger when you start from Level 1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Timer: If Speedrun Timer is off, it will show a per level timer instead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun Training Mode: By toggling this, you can train on a level, it will show you your best time of the level, and finishing it will make you restart it instead of going to the next one</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "This is your average precision platformer. Playable in 4 player Coop, a choice to have a speedrun timer for well, speedrunners, tons (maybe an exaggeration) of secrets and places to go out of bounds, tons of achievements, tons of CRT scanlines, and maybe, tons of fun?",
